{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108686","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108686/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108686/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108686/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108686","id":3237532154,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7A-NH6","number":108686,"title":"Button using different style types for background and text.","user":{"login":"lavishbehemoth","id":159974522,"node_id":"U_kgDOCYkEeg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159974522?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavishbehemoth","html_url":"https://github.com/lavishbehemoth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavishbehemoth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavishbehemoth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavishbehemoth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavishbehemoth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavishbehemoth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavishbehemoth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavishbehemoth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavishbehemoth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lavishbehemoth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-07-16T22:40:56Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T00:41:38Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.3.stable, 4.4.1.stable, 4.5.beta3,\n\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - v4.4.1.stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a button is focused and hovered, the stylebox used is `focus`, but the font color used is `font_hover_color`.\nI expect the stylebox and text to use the same style criteria as eachother. So they should either both use `font:font_hover_color` and `style_box:hover`, or they should both use `font:font_focus_color` and `style_box:focus`.\n\nThe button below has a red stylebox for `focus` and a red text for `font_focus_color`. But, it displays green text which is the `font_hover_color` when the mouse is hovering.\n<img width=\"1154\" height=\"680\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6c749a94-5165-450b-afff-0e3b1b3e6f94\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a button with `focus` stylebox and `font_focus_color`. Then Focus the button and hover the mouse over it. The stylebox will be shown, but the font color will not be shown.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[button_style_mismatch.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21267394/button_style_mismatch.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108686/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108686/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}